# Gesture three (16 bars): a short answer, low, into the last variation
pattern talk_3 {
    -  -  -  -   -  -  -  -   -  -  -  -   -  -  -  -
    -  -  -  -   -  -  -  -   -  -  -  -   -  -  -  -
